  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assessment of Correlation between End-Stage Kidney Disease under Maintenance Hemodialysis and its Association with Diabetes Hypertension in Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this assignment is to support the Vietnamese Ministry of Health in generating evidence on the correlation between ESKD under maintenance hemodialysis and major contributing factors, namely diabetes and hypertension. Findings from the assessment will serve as a foundation for the development of strategies and guidelines for the prevention, management, and reduction of complications among patients undergoing regular dialysis.</narrative>
  </description>
